Error [E0120]: `x` is only borrowed here, so it can't be given back as-is
  --> tests/ui/generic_infer_fail.jet:2:12
    |
  2 |     return x;
    |            ^
 Why: this function reads the value but doesn't own it
 Fix: return a copy: `return x.clone();` — or take ownership with `take x: T`

Error [E0112]: `print` doesn't know how to show fn(T) -> T
  --> tests/ui/generic_infer_fail.jet:7:11
    |
  7 |     print(id);
    |           ^^
 Why: print shows values that have a display
 Fix: print one of its parts instead
